1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
I love starting my day with a warm cup of tea, just to give the belly a big old hug.
我喜欢用一杯温热的茶开启一天，就像给肚子一个大大的拥抱。

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,080
I'm having a mint tea today.
我今天喝的是薄荷茶。

3
00:00:10,080 --> 00:00:13,121
There are so many different types of mint here.
这里有好多不同种类的薄荷。

4
00:00:13,121 --> 00:00:16,321
I didn't even realize that there were so many mint species.
我以前都没意识到，薄荷竟然有这么多种。

5
00:00:16,321 --> 00:00:20,801
The one that I will be using today is the chocolate mint.
我今天要用的是巧克力薄荷。

6
00:00:20,801 --> 00:00:27,201
And it just has this really sharp freshness to it, kind of like a spearmint.
它有一种很鲜明、清爽的气息，有点像留兰香薄荷。

7
00:00:27,201 --> 00:00:28,321
So delicious.
真好喝。

8
00:00:28,321 --> 00:00:32,641
I'm gonna mix it with some dandelion honey that Heidi's made.
我准备加一点 Heidi 做的蒲公英蜂蜜，把它们混合起来。

9
00:00:32,641 --> 00:00:37,161
And the combo is just absolutely delectable.
这个搭配实在是太美味了。

10
00:00:43,441 --> 00:00:55,601
These days, I've also started carving out time in the morning to practice music because living with a family where everyone loves to sing and plays an instrument has really reignited my appreciation for music.
最近我也开始在早晨特意腾出时间练习音乐。和一个人人都爱唱歌、会演奏乐器的家庭一起生活，让我重新找回了对音乐的喜爱。

11
00:00:55,601 --> 00:01:01,121
I used to take piano lessons as a kid, but it felt way more like a chore than enjoyment.
我小时候学过钢琴，但当时它更像一项不得不完成的任务，而不是享受。

12
00:01:01,121 --> 00:01:08,761
But now, before everyone wakes up, I’ve been really loving spending some time on the bench playing old songs and learning new ones.
但现在，趁大家还没起床，我很享受坐在琴凳上，弹弹旧曲子，再学几首新曲子。
